  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It seems various udon or other various things for worlds do not properly sync between the two branches causing networking discrepancies between them. For example, if a person on live writes with a world marker, the person on open beta will not see it, or if a person in open beta flies a jet, the person on live won't see it as well. \n\nMaking a canny in case this could be rectified but assuming this was expected.\n\nEdit: Actually I wonder if something more was changed because most of the scripts in Evolvedant Arcade straight up do not work on the OB even in an instance by myself.\n\nBroken world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_b7acb016-d29f-498b-9d40-0b9a6c38a820",
